<title>UK: UK'S FLARE TO RAISE 7.8 MLN STG.</title>
<headline>UK'S FLARE TO RAISE 7.8 MLN STG.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>British industrial ceramics supplier Flare Group Plc said on Friday it would place and offer 6.9 million shares at 120 pence each to raise about 7.8 million stg.</p>
<p>The money will be partially used to fund acquisitions of Elmeceram, a French ceramics equipment maker and Rathbone, a screen print transfer maker based in Stoke-on-Trent in the UK.</p>
<p>Flare is paying 2.33 million stg for Elmeceram and 1.15 million stg for Rathbone.</p>
<p>---London Newsroom +44 171 542 4042</p>
